@startuml
skinparam dpi 150
|System|
start
:Map subject to department;
:Select officer with fewest open cases;
:Set due date from urgency SLA;
:Notify officer;
|Officer|
:Open case and review AI labels;
if (Labels correct?) then (no)
  :Correct labels;
  |System|
  :Store correction for retraining;
  |Officer|
else (yes)
endif
:Investigate and update status;
|System|
if (Past due date and\nnot resolved?) then (yes)
  :Mark case as Escalated;
  |Supervisor|
  :Receive alert, reassign\nor intervene;
  |Officer|
  :Continue handling the case;
else (no)
endif
|Officer|
:Record resolution;
|System|
:Notify complainant;
:Close case and store\nresolution time;
stop
@enduml
